<item><title>Marie Sarr reaches taekwondo final, guaranteeing Senegal another Dakar 2026 medal</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/marie-sarr-reaches-taekwondo-final-guaranteeing-senegal-987a46/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/marie-sarr-reaches-taekwondo-final-guaranteeing-senegal-987a46/</guid><category>Senegal</category><description>The 55 kg taekwondo fighter beat American Karlee Vogel 2-0 at the Iba Mar Diop Complex, lifting Senegal into the top 10 medal-winning nations.</description><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:19:41 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/marie-sarr-reaches-taekwondo-final-guaranteeing-senegal-987a46/share.jpg" length="44925" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/marie-sarr-reaches-taekwondo-final-guaranteeing-senegal-987a46/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
